WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:06.210
<i>Nankatsu SC is engaged in a match against Hanawa Youth Football Association in a must-win situation,</i>

00:06.210 --> 00:08.860
<i>with a ticket to the final tournament at stake.</i>

00:08.860 --> 00:13.940
<i>Thanks to his coordinated play with Misaki, Tsubasa managed to open the score.</i>

00:13.940 --> 00:16.030
<i>However, the flow of the game completely changed in the second half.</i>

00:16.030 --> 00:20.620
<i>The trump card of the Tachibana Twins, the Triangle Shot, explodes!</i>

00:20.620 --> 00:24.410
<i>To further complicate things, Nishio was injured during the play.</i>

00:24.410 --> 00:28.630
<i>Player change for Nankatsu.</i>

00:28.630 --> 00:35.380
<i>#14 Ishizaki replaces #3 Nishio.</i>

00:35.380 --> 00:37.300
Ishizaki!

00:37.300 --> 00:38.800
We're counting on you, Ishizaki!

00:38.800 --> 00:41.260
Guys, I have a message from our coach.

00:41.260 --> 00:45.380
If we get a draw at the end of this game, we won't be able to go the finals.

00:45.380 --> 00:49.900
So, both Tsubasa and Misaki should attack as usual.

00:50.870 --> 00:53.780
All right! We'll do everything we can to score some goals. Right, Misaki?

00:53.780 --> 00:54.530
Yes!

00:54.530 --> 00:57.920
Masao, Kazuo! I trust you to keep this up and widen our lead.

00:57.920 --> 00:58.610
Yeah!

00:58.610 --> 01:01.200
You guys keep up your tight defense!

01:01.200 --> 01:02.520
Tsubasa! Do your best!

01:02.520 --> 01:06.390
<i>As Hanawa catches up, things have suddenly become interesting.</i>

01:06.390 --> 01:09.710
<i>The last match of the group stages of the National Youth Football Tournament,</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:15.970
<i>Nankatsu SC vs. Hanawa Youth Football Association, resumes with Nankatsu's kick-off.</i>

01:18.220 --> 01:22.860
<i>After Hanawa tied the game, Nankatsu changes their formation.</i>

01:22.860 --> 01:24.600
<i>Tsubasa and Misaki, who had been in charge of marking the Tachibana Twins</i>

01:24.600 --> 01:27.640
<i>have both moved forward in the field!</i>

01:27.640 --> 01:29.210
Tsubasa and Misaki!

01:29.210 --> 01:31.150
They are coming to attack us, too!

01:31.150 --> 01:34.670
All right! We'll properly block their advances!

01:34.670 --> 01:35.570
Yeah!

01:35.570 --> 01:38.650
<i>Will Nankatsu's Golden Duo, Tsubasa and Misaki,</i>

01:38.650 --> 01:41.570
<i>be able to overcome Hanawa's strong defense?</i>

01:42.580 --> 01:44.490
<i>Or will Hanawa stop the two in their tracks?</i>

01:45.620 --> 01:48.980
<i>Will it be Nankatsu or Hanawa who'll advance to the finals?</i>

01:48.980 --> 01:52.040
<i>Who will be the one laughing in the end?</i>

02:04.010 --> 02:09.640
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

02:04.060 --> 02:09.690
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

02:09.640 --> 02:14.650
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

02:09.690 --> 02:14.650
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

02:15.320 --> 02:20.490
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

02:15.320 --> 02:20.530
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

02:21.200 --> 02:28.870
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

02:21.200 --> 02:28.870
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:28.870 --> 02:34.590
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:28.870 --> 02:34.630
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

02:34.590 --> 02:43.140
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:34.630 --> 02:43.140
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:43.140 --> 02:48.930
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:43.140 --> 02:48.930
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

02:48.930 --> 02:54.860
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

02:48.930 --> 02:54.860
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

02:54.860 --> 02:56.320
<i>Run & Run!</i>

02:56.320 --> 03:03.610
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

02:56.320 --> 03:03.610
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

03:03.610 --> 03:06.530
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

03:03.610 --> 03:06.530
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

03:06.530 --> 03:11.460
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

03:06.530 --> 03:11.460
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

03:22.510 --> 03:27.540
<b><b>EPISODE 17:
4 MINUTES LEFT! A DECISIVE BATTLE IN MID-AIR!</b></b>

03:28.260 --> 03:31.540
<i>The pain in my left leg is almost gone.</i>

03:31.540 --> 03:33.700
<i>If it's this much, I think I can make it for a match at least...</i>

03:33.700 --> 03:34.810
Genzo!

03:34.810 --> 03:37.510
They've caught up to Nankatsu.

03:37.510 --> 03:39.170
What? How?

03:39.170 --> 03:40.780
They were doing so well.

03:40.780 --> 03:42.780
It was Hanawa's Tachibana Twins.

03:42.780 --> 03:45.610
<i>Tsubasa's got the ball.</i>

03:46.620 --> 03:47.430
Stop him!

03:47.430 --> 03:47.910
Yeah!

03:47.910 --> 03:51.660
<i>Tsubasa finds a small opening in the defense and takes his shot!</i>

03:51.660 --> 03:55.210
<i>The ball hits Aizawa! It's a close call.</i>

03:56.210 --> 03:58.380
Take this! Masao! Kazuo!

03:58.380 --> 03:59.250
All right!

03:59.250 --> 04:01.550
<i>The ball is passed forward to the Tachibana Twins!</i>

04:01.550 --> 04:04.040
<i>It's a chance for Hanawa to score another goal!</i>

04:04.040 --> 04:06.800
Those two have started to a do a special kind of

04:06.800 --> 04:09.270
combination play that they've kept hidden until now.

04:09.270 --> 04:10.930
A special combanation play?

04:10.930 --> 04:12.550
Let's do it again, Kazuo!

04:12.550 --> 04:13.430
All right!

04:14.760 --> 04:15.410
Ah?!

04:15.410 --> 04:16.270
This is—

04:16.830 --> 04:18.310
It's the same attack from before!

04:18.310 --> 04:19.110
We'll stop it!

04:19.110 --> 04:22.990
<i>Nankatsu quickly gathers around Masao!</i>

04:22.990 --> 04:24.990
I'm leaving it to you, Matsumoto!

04:24.990 --> 04:27.110
<i>Masao passes the ball back,</i>

04:27.910 --> 04:30.590
<i>and starts running towards to the goal by himself.</i>

04:30.590 --> 04:31.450
What?!

04:32.830 --> 04:34.710
Let's do this, Masao, Kazuo!

04:35.930 --> 04:38.540
<i>Matsumoto fires off a long pass!</i>

04:38.540 --> 04:42.460
<i>Both Masao and Kazuo keep on dashing forward.</i>

04:46.220 --> 04:47.680
What the...?!

04:48.340 --> 04:52.060
<i>Here comes their twin aerial acrobatic football again!</i>

04:52.060 --> 04:53.030
This time...

04:53.030 --> 04:54.520
They've both jumped at the same time!

04:54.520 --> 04:55.560
Which one...

04:55.560 --> 04:57.400
Which one will shoot?

04:58.610 --> 05:02.070
<i>Masao fires a screaming mid-air volley shot, trying to pierce the goal!</i>

05:02.070 --> 05:04.990
<i>Will Hanawa finally get the lead?</i>

05:06.120 --> 05:09.530
<i>No! Morisaki drives it away with a smart punch!</i>

05:09.530 --> 05:10.280
What?!

05:11.330 --> 05:12.990
You did it, Morisaki!

05:12.990 --> 05:15.200
<i>The ball goes to Ishizaki who has been hanging around near the back.</i>

05:15.200 --> 05:18.260
Good, Ishizaki! Pass it to Tsubasa and Misaki!

05:18.260 --> 05:19.460
Okay!

05:19.460 --> 05:20.170
What?

05:20.540 --> 05:21.400
That can't be.

05:21.400 --> 05:23.300
<i>Oh no, what a huge gaffe!</i>

05:24.880 --> 05:29.720
<i>It goes into the goal! Nankatsu suffers an own goal!</i>

05:31.470 --> 05:33.170
Yes, we did it! Lucky!

05:33.170 --> 05:34.930
We've got ourselves a second goal!

05:38.570 --> 05:41.190
<i>How stupid! That's what you get for having someone like him on the field.</i>

05:41.190 --> 05:44.900
<i>With this, things are really looking good for us.</i>

05:44.900 --> 05:47.070
What the hell do you think you're doing, Ishizaki?!

05:47.070 --> 05:49.280
How could you score on our own goal?!

05:49.280 --> 05:51.200
I'm... I'm sorry...

05:51.200 --> 05:55.400
We have to win this match at all costs!

05:55.400 --> 05:56.480
And yet you—

05:56.480 --> 05:58.330
Stop it!

05:58.330 --> 06:00.160
Misaki...

06:00.160 --> 06:03.250
Please, stop fighting each other.

06:03.250 --> 06:09.510
I didn't want to tell you yet, but this tournament will be the last one where I get to play with all of you.

06:09.510 --> 06:11.280
What?!

06:11.280 --> 06:12.340
Misaki...?

06:12.340 --> 06:15.220
So, please, let's stop fighting each other.

06:15.220 --> 06:17.400
Misaki...

06:17.400 --> 06:19.210
Are you saying that...

06:19.210 --> 06:20.230
You'll transfer schools again?

06:20.860 --> 06:21.810
Yeah.

06:22.850 --> 06:25.770
However, even though I've kept changing schools,

06:25.770 --> 06:30.480
Nankatsu is the first and only team with whom I was able to play football

06:30.480 --> 06:32.620
all the way into the National Tournament.

06:32.620 --> 06:37.660
That's why... I want to win at all costs, and leave as a champion.

06:38.250 --> 06:39.410
Misaki...

06:44.170 --> 06:46.830
So come on, the real game starts now, guys!

06:46.830 --> 06:50.260
Let's turn this around for Misaki's sake, too!

06:50.260 --> 06:52.260
Tsubasa...

06:52.260 --> 06:53.900
Yes, you're right!

06:53.900 --> 06:55.330
The real match starts now!

06:55.330 --> 06:56.010
Yeah!

06:56.010 --> 06:57.940
Let's turn the tables around!

06:57.940 --> 07:01.210
We'll be the ones to advance to the finals!

07:01.960 --> 07:02.600
Morisaki!

07:04.280 --> 07:04.860
Here you go.

07:06.240 --> 07:08.610
All right, everyone! Put your entire soul into it!

07:08.610 --> 07:10.490
Yeah!

07:10.490 --> 07:12.000
That's the spirit! Don't lose!

07:12.000 --> 07:13.510
Let's show them we can make an immediate comeback!

07:13.510 --> 07:15.940
Fight, Nankatsu!

07:15.940 --> 07:19.360
Ishizaki, don't worry about it!

07:20.200 --> 07:21.120
Yeah...

07:21.120 --> 07:22.950
They are so dumb!

07:22.950 --> 07:25.290
Once we get a one-goal lead, this match is as good as ours.

07:25.290 --> 07:29.590
<i>Nankatsu has conceded an unfortunate goal and now find themselves in a tight spot.</i>

07:29.590 --> 07:34.720
<i>Getting a draw in this match won't work for them if they want to advance to the finals.</i>

07:34.720 --> 07:37.170
<i>Unless they score two more goals and win this match,</i>

07:37.170 --> 07:40.100
<i>they won't be able to advance to the finals.</i>

07:42.940 --> 07:44.700
<i>The match resumes.</i>

07:44.700 --> 07:48.110
<i>Looking to change the flow of the game, Nankatsu fiercely come attacking into Hanawa's side!</i>

07:48.110 --> 07:50.150
All right, let's start by scoring a goal!

07:50.150 --> 07:51.030
Okay!

07:51.630 --> 07:54.160
<i>Please win this, Tsubasa, and keep advancing in this tournament.</i>

07:54.160 --> 07:57.870
<i>I can't wait to play against you.</i>

07:57.870 --> 07:59.730
<i>Aiming to score the goal that'll start their comeback,</i>

07:59.730 --> 08:03.120
<i>Nankatsu is putting all of their strength into attacking.</i>

08:03.120 --> 08:04.920
You, over there, get to covering!

08:04.920 --> 08:06.130
I'll stop them right here!

08:06.890 --> 08:10.550
<i>However, Hanawa's defense tightens up!</i>

08:11.900 --> 08:12.800
Tsubasa!

08:13.500 --> 08:16.510
<i>Oh, the pass meant for Tsubasa is intercepted.</i>

08:16.510 --> 08:21.060
<i>Taki runs towards the line, but Oizumi won't let him through.</i>

08:21.660 --> 08:24.690
<i>Matsumoto sends the ball out of the touch-line.</i>

08:24.690 --> 08:26.450
<i>Nankatsu attacks with all they've got,</i>

08:26.450 --> 08:29.820
<i>but they keep getting caught up in Hanawa's solid defense and can't score.</i>

08:30.610 --> 08:32.400
<i>What are you doing, guys?</i>

08:36.640 --> 08:37.490
<i>Damn it!</i>

08:38.010 --> 08:40.160
<i>This is all my fault!</i>

08:40.160 --> 08:42.620
<i>The match resumes with Nankatsu's throw-in.</i>

08:42.620 --> 08:43.790
Over here!

08:44.520 --> 08:45.040
Eh?

08:46.960 --> 08:47.630
Take this!

08:48.540 --> 08:51.800
<i>The ball gets to Taki. He goes on the offensive once again.</i>

08:51.800 --> 08:55.880
<i>However, the worst thing for Nankatsu right now,</i>

08:55.880 --> 08:58.430
<i>is that Tsubasa is being completely marked by the goal.</i>

08:58.430 --> 08:59.050
Damn it!

08:59.050 --> 09:03.840
Marking Hyuga in our match against Meiwa taught us a lot!

09:03.840 --> 09:05.060
Sure did.

09:05.060 --> 09:09.130
With that kind of marking, it's hard to pass to Tsubasa.

09:10.010 --> 09:11.070
Taki!

09:11.070 --> 09:12.350
Over here!

09:12.350 --> 09:15.440
<i>Nankatsu's Kisugi starts running to the other side of the field.</i>

09:15.440 --> 09:18.240
They call me Shutetsu's scorer for a reason!

09:18.240 --> 09:21.620
I'll tie the score with this!

09:21.620 --> 09:22.870
<i>A direct shot!</i>

09:23.790 --> 09:27.040
<i>Goalkeeper Kobayashi slides on his side to make the catch.</i>

09:27.040 --> 09:28.710
Wow, nice save!

09:28.710 --> 09:29.710
Damn it!

09:29.710 --> 09:31.030
Keep fighting!

09:31.030 --> 09:33.800
We believe in you, Nankatsu! Get those goals and make your comeback!

09:33.800 --> 09:36.430
Don't let them catch you, Hanawa!

09:36.430 --> 09:40.310
<i>With a berth in the finals at stake, Nankatsu vs. Hanawa continues!</i>

09:40.310 --> 09:44.950
<i>15 minutes have passed, and there are only 5 minutes remaining in this game!</i>

09:44.950 --> 09:47.560
<i>It looks like this is as far as Nankatsu will go.</i>

09:47.560 --> 09:51.440
<i>You can't help but notice how well Hanawa is enduring Nankatsu's attacks.</i>

09:51.440 --> 09:55.860
<i>Protecting that one goal lead, it really looks like they believe they've won this,</i>

09:55.860 --> 09:57.950
<i>and they aren't letting the pressure get to them.</i>

09:57.950 --> 09:59.910
<i>Hanawa's defense is perfect!</i>

09:59.910 --> 10:00.910
Izawa!

10:01.960 --> 10:02.780
Got it!

10:02.780 --> 10:03.740
Oh no!

10:03.740 --> 10:06.470
<i>Nankatsu is caught panicking!</i>

10:06.470 --> 10:08.660
<i>The ball is stolen from them by Hanawa!</i>

10:08.660 --> 10:09.580
Take this!

10:09.580 --> 10:12.230
<i>A long pass is sent to the Tachibana Twins up front!</i>

10:12.230 --> 10:14.630
<i>If Nankatsu were to concede another goal here,</i>

10:14.630 --> 10:18.090
<i>their hopes of advancing to the finals would be as good as gone!</i>

10:18.090 --> 10:20.380
All right! Let's score another one and wrap up this victory!

10:23.210 --> 10:23.990
Eh?!

10:23.990 --> 10:25.920
<i>That's a great move!</i>

10:25.920 --> 10:28.770
<i>Ishizaki intercepts the ball!</i>

10:28.770 --> 10:29.770
-Ishizaki! -Ishizaki!

10:29.770 --> 10:30.770
-Ishizaki!

10:30.770 --> 10:33.310
<i>Ishizaki dribbles ahead.</i>

10:33.310 --> 10:36.840
<i>We fell behind this game due to my mistake.</i>

10:36.840 --> 10:39.250
<i>After winning all these matches with everyone...</i>

10:39.250 --> 10:41.570
<i>There's no way in hell I'd let us down like this!</i>

10:41.570 --> 10:43.200
<i>Ishizaki!</i>

10:43.200 --> 10:46.540
<i>For Misaki, who will have to transfer and leave us...</i>

10:46.540 --> 10:50.830
<i>I'll give this goal right back!</i>

10:50.830 --> 10:53.630
<i>Ishizaki fires a determined long shot!</i>

10:53.630 --> 10:55.040
Okay.

10:55.040 --> 10:58.300
<i>But it's headed straight for the goalkeeper—</i>

11:00.620 --> 11:04.680
<i>Misaki dives in, redirecting the ball!</i>

11:05.880 --> 11:07.430
<i>Goal!</i>

11:07.430 --> 11:10.420
<i>Nankatsu has tied the game with just 4 minutes left!</i>

11:10.420 --> 11:12.190
<i>They have finally caught up!</i>

11:12.950 --> 11:14.560
<i>It's 2-2, a draw!</i>

11:14.560 --> 11:17.620
<i>With this, we are back to square one!</i>

11:17.620 --> 11:20.790
I did it!

11:24.030 --> 11:29.040
Ishizaki player card

11:30.760 --> 11:32.540
<i>Nankatsu has tied the game!</i>

11:32.540 --> 11:35.350
Th—Thank you, Misaki!

11:35.350 --> 11:38.910
<i>With only 4 minutes left in the second half, Nankatsu manage to tie it up!</i>

11:38.910 --> 11:40.460
We're tied!

11:40.460 --> 11:42.760
<i>It really was a hell of a play.</i>

11:42.760 --> 11:45.240
<i>A gentle push from Misaki as though he'd planned it all along!</i>

11:45.240 --> 11:47.290
<i>And for Ishizaki, he shot off a good long shot,</i>

11:47.290 --> 11:50.140
<i>right after breaking the opponent's offense!</i>

11:50.140 --> 11:54.560
<i>It was a marvelous play, helping to bury his past mistakes!</i>

11:54.560 --> 11:59.720
<i>You're the kind of man who gets it done when it counts, Ishizaki.</i>

11:59.720 --> 12:03.400
Let's get one more and win this!

12:03.400 --> 12:04.660
Yeah!

12:04.660 --> 12:07.160
That's it Ishizaki! You also endured that hellish training,

12:07.160 --> 12:09.660
just like everyone else on this team!

12:09.660 --> 12:11.310
Keep it up!

12:12.120 --> 12:15.670
<i>Still, Nankatsu need to score another goal</i>

12:15.670 --> 12:18.750
<i>in the remaining 4 minutes to advance into the finals!</i>

12:18.750 --> 12:23.920
<i>Meanwhile, Hanawa will be fine with a tie.</i>

12:23.920 --> 12:27.180
Damn it! We must defend this score, no matter what!

12:27.180 --> 12:30.510
<i>Which team will the goddess of victory smile upon?!</i>

12:30.510 --> 12:34.140
<i>This match is heading towards its climax!</i>

12:34.140 --> 12:36.370
<i>You have come this far.</i>

12:36.370 --> 12:38.900
<i>Hanawa, you must pull through somehow.</i>

12:39.900 --> 12:44.400
<i>Score one more and advance to the nationals, Tsubasa.</i>

12:47.080 --> 12:50.580
If it's come to this, we'll just have to score another one by ourselves!

12:51.020 --> 12:54.820
<i>The Tachibana Twins start dribbling ahead as soon as the match resumes!</i>

12:54.820 --> 12:57.960
Let's steal another goal before they can go back to their mid-air acrobatics!

12:58.410 --> 12:59.040
Yeah!

13:02.210 --> 13:06.150
<i>Nankatsu are fired up after tying the game!</i>

13:06.150 --> 13:08.260
<i>They won't let the Tachibana Twins do as they please!</i>

13:08.260 --> 13:09.390
Let's go!

13:10.300 --> 13:11.390
Masao!

13:15.020 --> 13:17.270
<i>Masao is furiously chased down!</i>

13:17.980 --> 13:18.560
Damn it all!

13:19.660 --> 13:23.110
<i>The Tachibana Twins won't lose the ball so easily!</i>

13:24.440 --> 13:25.670
We will steal the ball here!

13:25.670 --> 13:26.360
Sure!

13:29.240 --> 13:32.990
<i>Masao dodges two in the blink of an eye!</i>

13:32.990 --> 13:34.370
Nice going, Masao!

13:34.370 --> 13:36.330
That's bad, go after him!

13:36.330 --> 13:40.130
<i>The Tachibana Twins are closing down on Nankatsu's defensive line again!</i>

13:40.130 --> 13:44.130
<i>I will steal this ball no matter what.</i>

13:44.130 --> 13:47.630
<i>Nankatsu catches up with Masao!</i>

13:47.630 --> 13:49.140
le rawr

13:49.140 --> 13:50.590
Kazuo!

13:50.590 --> 13:51.350
All right!

13:51.350 --> 13:54.580
<i>Misaki continues to do a great job today as he reads the course of the pass</i>

13:54.580 --> 13:57.350
<i>and cuts the ball mid-flight!</i>

13:57.350 --> 13:58.140
Crap!

13:58.140 --> 14:00.190
Nice interception, Misaki!

14:00.190 --> 14:03.270
<i>Okay, I won't lose to him!</i>

14:05.050 --> 14:07.800
<i>Nankatsu has finally gotten a hold of the ball!</i>

14:07.800 --> 14:09.660
<i>They turn and push towards Hanawa's goal!</i>

14:09.660 --> 14:11.940
If we let them score here, it will be all over for us!

14:11.940 --> 14:14.350
Concentrate and defend the goal until the very end!

14:14.350 --> 14:15.160
Yeah!

14:15.160 --> 14:17.820
<i>Nankatsu's offense and Hanawa defenders.</i>

14:17.820 --> 14:21.080
<i>It's their last battle, with advancement to the finals at stake!</i>

14:22.100 --> 14:23.000
Here it goes!

14:23.000 --> 14:25.000
<i>Misaki fires away!</i>

14:25.760 --> 14:28.010
<i>The ball hits and is deflected by a defender.</i>

14:28.810 --> 14:30.760
<i>It's a corner kick for Nankatsu.</i>

14:30.760 --> 14:32.210
<i>Have a look at this!</i>

14:32.210 --> 14:34.050
<i>Hanawa has gone into a defensive formation with all of their members,</i>

14:34.050 --> 14:35.990
<i>save for the Tachibana Twins.</i>

14:35.990 --> 14:38.350
<i>They've formed an incredible wall before the goal!</i>

14:38.350 --> 14:42.610
<i>Will Nankatsu manage to break this wall and score?!</i>

14:42.610 --> 14:45.520
<i>There are only 3 minutes left!</i>

14:51.360 --> 14:52.360
Hurry up, Taki!

14:52.360 --> 14:54.360
another rawr comes from taki

14:57.120 --> 14:58.800
<i>The ball flies in front of the goal!</i>

14:58.800 --> 15:01.080
<i>Is Nankatsu going to try to head it in?</i>

15:01.850 --> 15:04.610
<i>The keeper Kobayashi jumps and punches the ball away!</i>

15:04.610 --> 15:05.750
<i>Brilliant decision-making!</i>

15:05.750 --> 15:07.630
Good job, keeper!

15:07.630 --> 15:10.630
<i>The ball drops at Tsubasa's feet!</i>

15:10.630 --> 15:11.470
All right!

15:11.470 --> 15:13.970
<i>The keeper is still recovering!</i>

15:13.970 --> 15:16.030
<i>Tsubasa quickly shoots!</i>

15:20.030 --> 15:22.940
<i>Tsubasa's shot is blocked with his body!</i>

15:23.550 --> 15:26.270
<i>It's Masao Tachibana!</i>

15:26.270 --> 15:28.480
Going good Hanawa!

15:28.480 --> 15:32.020
<i>The Tachibana Twins, who were not supposed to participate in defense,</i>

15:32.020 --> 15:33.490
<i>had their part in it!</i>

15:34.400 --> 15:37.330
<i>I won't let you score, even if it costs me my life!</i>

15:38.450 --> 15:41.370
Having you guys here is like having 100 men!

15:41.370 --> 15:43.420
Sure, leave it to us!

15:43.420 --> 15:48.210
<i>With the Tachibana Twins joining the defense, it has become a literal all-man defense!</i>

15:48.760 --> 15:52.210
<i>Hanawa's defense has become all the more intense.</i>

15:52.210 --> 15:54.220
<i>When a team like Hanawa, who already has a reputation for its defense,</i>

15:54.220 --> 15:55.680
<i>doubles down on their defending,</i>

15:55.680 --> 15:59.310
<i>even Nankatsu can't shoot the ball!</i>

16:00.480 --> 16:02.770
<i>The 20th minute of the second half is here!</i>

16:02.770 --> 16:04.900
<i>There is just one minute of additional time.</i>

16:04.900 --> 16:06.770
<i>Nankatsu is out of options!</i>

16:06.770 --> 16:09.330
Tsubasa, Misaki! Do something!

16:09.330 --> 16:10.780
There isn't any time left!

16:15.030 --> 16:17.040
All right, just a little more.

16:17.040 --> 16:20.410
I won't ever let you shoot!

16:20.410 --> 16:24.920
<i>Just... how should we attack such an intense defense?</i>

16:36.000 --> 16:40.140
<i>Is this really going the be my last game with them?</i>

16:40.140 --> 16:42.680
<i>I won't let it end here!</i>

16:43.680 --> 16:46.300
<i>Nankatsu will win!</i>

16:46.300 --> 16:48.610
<i>As the captain, I will not accept anything else!</i>

16:50.400 --> 16:52.400
Misaki, send it up!

16:54.730 --> 16:55.820
Oh—I see!

16:55.820 --> 17:01.450
<i>Misaki sends a ball high with the signal from Tsubasa.</i>

17:01.450 --> 17:02.330
<i>What are they up to?</i>

17:02.330 --> 17:04.660
Masao, don't tell me that guy...

17:06.580 --> 17:10.910
<i>This is the Tachibana Twins' speciality, mid-air football!</i>

17:10.910 --> 17:13.090
<i>Tsubasa has copied their technique!</i>

17:13.090 --> 17:16.590
<i>He has beaten his markers in mid-air!</i>

17:18.380 --> 17:21.470
<i>Tsubasa executes a somersault overhead kick in the air!</i>

17:22.540 --> 17:25.430
<i>It's in! Goal!</i>

17:27.010 --> 17:28.900
<i>Nankatsu has finally turned the tides!</i>

17:28.900 --> 17:30.020
Tsubasa!

17:30.020 --> 17:31.900
We did it, it's a complete comeback!

17:31.900 --> 17:34.290
You did it, Tsubasa!

17:37.490 --> 17:39.990
<i>Finally, the whistle blows!</i>

17:40.480 --> 17:43.740
<i>With their last-ditch effort, this fierce battle comes to an end! It's 3-2!</i>

17:43.740 --> 17:49.250
<i>The ones who have seized this victory are the Shizuoka representatives, Nankatsu SC!</i>

17:49.250 --> 17:52.750
<i>Nankatsu has guaranteed its spot in the finals,</i>

17:52.750 --> 17:57.380
<i>placing second behind Meiwa FC!</i>

17:57.380 --> 17:58.690
We did it!

17:58.690 --> 17:59.840
We got past the group stages!

17:59.840 --> 18:00.850
Good job!

18:01.410 --> 18:02.850
Tsubasa...

18:04.060 --> 18:05.350
Congratulations.

18:06.010 --> 18:11.360
<i>Thank you Tsubasa! Now we can all keep playing together a while longer.</i>

18:11.360 --> 18:13.480
<i> Nankatsu managed to overcome this fierce trial.</i>

18:11.840 --> 18:12.870
Phew...

18:12.870 --> 18:13.480
Indeed...

18:13.480 --> 18:16.440
They made it into the finals with a score of 3-2.

18:14.040 --> 18:16.440
They really had me sweating, there.

18:16.440 --> 18:18.450
You did it, Tsubasa!

18:18.450 --> 18:22.740
<i>I can't wait to finally play against you.</i>

18:22.740 --> 18:26.750
<i>Nankatsu advanced, just as I thought.</i>

18:26.750 --> 18:30.000
Roberto, Tsubasa actually did it!

18:31.930 --> 18:33.340
Roberto?

18:33.340 --> 18:34.990
Hanawa, you did great!

18:34.990 --> 18:36.590
Congratulations, Nankatsu.

18:36.590 --> 18:38.440
Damn it!

18:38.440 --> 18:40.590
We were so close to making it to the finals...

18:40.590 --> 18:43.280
We fought with all we had.

18:43.280 --> 18:45.430
Let's keep our heads up until the end.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.100
Yeah.

18:47.100 --> 18:49.350
Thank you so much for cheering for us!

18:50.020 --> 18:51.850
Try again guys!

18:54.430 --> 18:58.150
Do your best in our stead in the finals.

18:58.150 --> 18:59.200
Sure.

19:15.750 --> 19:21.540
<i>He won't relent until he makes every football technique known to man his own.</i>

19:22.190 --> 19:26.060
Tsubasa, I remember the first time I met you.

19:29.370 --> 19:31.730
<i>Even though I didn't teach you a thing,</i>

19:31.730 --> 19:34.980
<i>you kept growing up with every single match.</i>

19:38.000 --> 19:43.190
Maybe Tsubasa doesn't even need me anymore.

19:48.130 --> 19:52.990
<i>The matches of the group stages of the National Youth Football Tournament have concluded.</i>

19:52.990 --> 19:57.800
<i>All 16 teams who have advanced to the finals stage are gathered here.</i>

19:58.370 --> 20:00.880
So, you'll really be changing schools?

20:00.880 --> 20:04.970
Yes. I'll be moving to another school again for the second semester.

20:05.390 --> 20:06.310
I see...

20:07.260 --> 20:10.980
If it has come to this, then our only choice is to become champions with Misaki.

20:10.980 --> 20:12.690
Tsubasa...

20:12.690 --> 20:15.760
There's no way that I'll let you leave us as a loser.

20:15.760 --> 20:17.250
All right, we are aiming for the champion's title!

20:17.250 --> 20:18.870
We'll be champions with Misaki!

20:19.580 --> 20:21.120
Thank you, guys!

20:21.120 --> 20:23.150
Hey, Misaki!

20:23.850 --> 20:25.360
It's the guys from Furano....

20:25.360 --> 20:28.450
You were great during today's match, Misaki.

20:28.450 --> 20:31.500
According to the draws in the finals stage, Furano and Nankatsu won't be playing each other

20:31.500 --> 20:35.480
unless we both advance to the final match.

20:35.480 --> 20:37.040
Wow, you're right.

20:37.040 --> 20:40.860
If possible, I'd love to play our final match between Nankatsu and Furano, if we make it.

20:40.860 --> 20:42.300
Yeah, you bet!

20:43.170 --> 20:50.260
<i>I keep changing schools, but thanks to football, I was able to make this many friends.</i>

20:50.260 --> 20:52.690
Captain, the meeting is about to start.

20:52.690 --> 20:54.140
Okay.

20:54.540 --> 20:56.120
See you later, Misaki.

21:00.490 --> 21:01.270
Sorry...

21:03.980 --> 21:04.950
Captain!

21:04.950 --> 21:06.910
Look where you're going, you idiot!

21:06.910 --> 21:07.950
Kojiro!

21:09.030 --> 21:10.630
You rotten bastard!

21:10.630 --> 21:12.250
Stop it, Matsuyama!

21:12.250 --> 21:13.440
Misaki...

21:13.440 --> 21:18.020
Don't get carried away just because you were able advance to the finals, Misaki!

21:18.020 --> 21:18.710
What?!

21:18.710 --> 21:21.710
In the end, it will be Meiwa's victory!

21:21.710 --> 21:23.960
I've had enough of this!

21:23.960 --> 21:26.880
Stop! Settle this on the pitch!

21:27.880 --> 21:29.340
Tsubasa...

21:31.010 --> 21:36.640
Tsubasa is right. Getting injured before the match would be troublesome.

21:36.640 --> 21:39.020
Jun Misugi...

21:39.020 --> 21:42.780
My, my... looks like you're having fun, guys.

21:42.780 --> 21:44.720
Isn't he—

21:44.720 --> 21:47.360
He's the goalkeeper of Naniwa FC, Nakanishi!

21:47.360 --> 21:52.540
My Nankatsu fellows, if I'm not wrong, the first match in the finals will be between us.

21:52.540 --> 21:55.830
Well, please go easy on us, will you?

22:06.590 --> 22:09.540
Everyone looks so strong, Tsubasa.

22:09.540 --> 22:12.600
Yes. I'm really looking forward to our matches from now on.

22:13.040 --> 22:17.380
All right! Wait for us, finals!

22:38.820 --> 22:44.700
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.820 --> 22:44.700
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.700 --> 22:50.710
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.700 --> 22:50.710
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.710 --> 22:56.720
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.710 --> 22:56.720
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.720 --> 23:02.180
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.720 --> 23:02.180
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.140 --> 23:08.310
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.140 --> 23:08.310
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.230 --> 23:15.030
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.230 --> 23:15.030
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.030 --> 23:21.070
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.070 --> 23:26.080
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.070 --> 23:26.080
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.370 --> 23:33.250
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.370 --> 23:33.250
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.250 --> 23:39.130
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.130 --> 23:46.020
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.130 --> 23:46.020
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.110 --> 24:00.680
COMING UP, EPISODE 18:
HERE WE COME, FINALS!
